y. Under his leadership, the institution is undergoing a bold new era of growth and innovation. Learn About President Gittell In This Section Sibling Nav AI at Bryant At a Glance Centers and Institutes Contact Us Global Advisory Council Leadership & Faculty External Conferences and Events Mission & History Office of Institutional Effectiveness & Strategy Smithfield Resources Sustainability Wellbeing at Bryant Working at Bryant Employee Directory Partnering With Bryant President’s Cabinet Bryant University’s senior leaders are drivers of change. They serve in an advisory capacity to the president, guide the university’s work, and inspire their teams to achieve positive change within the Bryant community. Inge-Lise Ameer Ed.D. Vice-President for Student Affairs and Dean of Students Gene Begin Chief Marketing Officer and Vice President for Communications Michelle L. Cloutier ’05MBA Vice President for Enrollment Management Chris Lehman MBA Chief Human Resources Officer and Vice President Donna Ng MBA Chief Financial Officer and Vice President for Business Affairs Rupendra Paliwal Ph.D. Provost and Chief Academic Officer Bill Smith J.D. Vice President Athletics and Recreation Edinaldo Tebaldi Ph.D. P'29 Vice President for Strategy and Partnerships David Wegrzyn ’86, P’23 Vice President for University Advancement Our Faculty View Faculty Our dedicated faculty provide an education that offers our students the knowledge and skills to thrive in an age of global complexity and change. Charles\n    Cullinan Ph D, MS, BS Professor Kevin\n    J.\n    Maloney Ph D, MA, BA Executive in Residence Suhong\n    Li Ph D, M Sc, BSBA Department Chair Information Systems and Analytics Elzotbek\n    Rustambekov Ph D, M Sc, MBA, BBA Department Chair Management Michael\n    Gravier Ph D, MS, BA Department Chair Marketing Christopher\n    Morse Ph D, MA, BA Department Chair Communication and Language Studies Amber\n    Day Ph D, MA, BA Department Chair History, Literature, and the Arts Gao\n 